# Allowlist for scripts/check-secrets.mjs (see SECURITY.md). One entry per line; "#" starts a comment.
#
#   fp:<16 hex>             ignore one exact value: copy the fp:… the scanner printed with the finding
#   path:<glob>             skip files entirely, e.g. path:docs/fixtures/**
#   rule:<rule-id>:<glob>   turn one rule off for some files, e.g. rule:jwt:tests/fixtures/**
#
# For a single line in a source file, a trailing "check-secrets:allow" comment is simpler.
# Never allowlist a real credential: remove it and rotate it.
